_:n895a3da48ab64029b02911387d24ea79b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:Join must specify exactly one rml:parent/rml:parentMap \n    and rml:child/rml:childMap.\n    " .
_:nbbf4b2dc1ec345229b4eae26372d1238b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:child/rml:childMap may only be provided once and \n        not at the same time.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SubjectMap" .
_:n924ccb5cd0f04300ad4a9dbb5e35453bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLReferenceFormulationShape> .
_:n1665e11199cb4796b72ffe7db39ea600b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specified the language map for the object component for the \n        generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:n17218be7ccaa4013896109e5e047ef26b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n895a3da48ab64029b02911387d24ea79b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "strategy" .
