_:n9b67a09e4cdb482cb48adaf422f1b0e9b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/cartesianProduct> .
_:n5deb4dfba6c14234bd6fd5ef905c7feab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:n1dda7b6dca28488faa5b591caeecbaadb7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n1665e11199cb4796b72ffe7db39ea600b10 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "datatype" .
_:n924ccb5cd0f04300ad4a9dbb5e35453bb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:iterator" .
_:nc71b5b6dff154d64aa439df8f0e53dd4b30 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:nc71b5b6dff154d64aa439df8f0e53dd4b28 .
_:n1dda7b6dca28488faa5b591caeecbaadb18 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:ncff12276a30c47e5bb5238b2c9011d7fb5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A reference rml:reference is used to refer to a column in case of \n        databases, a record in case of CSV or TSV data source, an element in \n        case of XML data source, an object in case of a JSON data source, etc.\n\n        A reference must be a valid identifier, considering the reference \n        formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) specified. The reference can be\n        an absolute path, or a path relative to the iterator specified at the \n        logical source. \n        " .
_:nd893b5d3ce3b417ba445ffae1be4633cb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:nd893b5d3ce3b417ba445ffae1be4633cb3 .
_:nbbf4b2dc1ec345229b4eae26372d1238b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:parentMap must point to a rml:ParentMap specifying the \n        parent tag of the string Literal.\n        " .
_:n1665e11199cb4796b72ffe7db39ea600b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n1665e11199cb4796b72ffe7db39ea600b6 .
_:n4820f9431c7843049344f3fc8b53f0d4b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n                PREFIX rml: <http://w3id.org/rml/>\n                SELECT $this\n                WHERE {\n                    $this rml:constant ?value .\n                    FILTER (lang(?value) != \"\")\n                }\n            " .
